<title>INDIA: India's CARE assigns a PR1 rating to KPTL.</title>
<headline>India's CARE assigns a PR1 rating to KPTL.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Analysis &amp; Research Ltd (CARE) said on Thursday it assigned a &quot;PR1&quot; rating to the commercial paper issue of 50 million rupees of Kalpataru Power Trasmission Limited (KPTL) for a maturity not exceeding six months.</p>
<p>KPTL, belonging to the Kalpataru group, is engaged in the design and fabrication of transmission line towers and real estate development.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
